<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">MKLS-OMU SEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Makolose</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku Makolose</para>
  <para style="toc2">Makolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Makol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKOLOSE</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo ku kwaasima kolose kame lina kun̄oliwa kwa mu tumiwa Paulusi (1.1). Kame ana kun̄ola elin̄olo yoli mutolongo, mwendi neli mu Loma, mu myaka makumi atanu ni kamweya munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Asimakolose, bamweya nelyo no maefese mane ni lya Filimoni, kame aisaniwa nji asi tolong kakuli Paulusi kame ana kwan̄ola yoli mutolongo. Kame anakun̄ola elin̄olo eli ku Keleke mu mulenen̄i no Makolose. Paulusi kasiku tateka ekeleke mu Makolose, kanyi omo aambele mu 2.1; kono kame ana kufanena okuyupa etukelo yayo. Kame kukonahala nji Epafulasi yona kutateka Ekeleke kakuli kame atundelela ku Makolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi kame ana kutwalela onene etingana ku tituto no mapwa mu Keleke mu Kolose. Nakumana aman̄olo no kupula okun̄ola eyi. Mwendi kame kuna kwikala esikwata no alumeli no majuda ao ana kweteka okukandimeka akoo aalumeli nji akon̄e emilao no aendisi no majuda okutunda mu tesitamente no Kale, onene eyi no mupato. Paulusi kame an̄ola feela nji alumeli kasaela esinjili simba omunu konji fela Kilesite nji cwale atambulwe kwa Nyambe (1.15-20) mi etituto eto kame tina kwimana ba mabaka no unu katikwite tuso (2.8).</para>
  <para style="iot">EMITWI NO YAMBO</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame atateka elin̄olo mu kukeeta Ekeleke mu Kolose (1.1-2).</para>
  <para style="io2">Cwale kame an̄ola okuneneba kwa Kilesite onene mu kutambula ku tituto no mapwa mu Kolose (1.3-3; 4).</para>
  <para style="io3">Kanyi mu man̄olo no kupula a Paulusi kame amana elicika no mamaneneno okuba etitaelo ku muyoyelo no alumeli ao ali wino (3. 5-4; 6).</para>
  <para style="io4">Paulusi kame amana okukeeta mane ni titaelo nji elin̄olo libaliwe mu tikeleke tinjili (4.7-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa mene Paulusi, omutumiwa wa Kilesite Jesu mu kusinga kwa Nyambe, kame nili ni Timoteya omwabetu.<verse eid="COL 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Kame ni n̄olela aanu a Nyambe no kukena ni kusepahala mwa Kilesite awo ali mu Kolose nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Esishemo siikale mwaanyi ni kozo itunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo no Witumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Kame tuku tumelanga kwa Nyambe mu nako yonje, Sitaye Ombumu wetu Jesu Kilesite mu titapelo aba tu milapelelanga. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Kakuli kame tuna yupu eyi no tumelo yenu mwa Kilesite Jesu ni lilato muli nalyo kwaanu a Nyambe no kukena onje. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Cwale mulibaka no sepo ina beekelwe anyi ku wilu. Eyo muna yupu oweli mu liywi no niti lyonyene eliywi no kuwaba, <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>elyo lineyi kwaanyi, kanyi aba lineeyi mu litunga lyonje, mi kame libeeka embuya ni kukula, cwale mukaci kenu okutunda ba liywaa elyo muna yupu ni kuyupisisa esishemo sa Nyambe mu niti. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Kanyi aba muna kwiiyeteyo kwa Epafulasi omukwetu omubika osingiwa. Niwa kusepahala esikombwa sa Jesu mu kutwimanena, <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>cwale yona tulimukisa elilato elyo muli nalyo mu Mebo.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Mi cwale okutunda ba liywaa tuna kuyupa eyo, ka tusi lesela oku milapelela ni kumi kumbelela nji mwiyale ezibo no kusinga kwaye muku shangama konje mu mebo mane ni kuyupisisa. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Nji muyoye mu mukwa owo ofanena wa Mbumu, omuwabelisa luli. Mu beeke embuya mu musebezi onje no kuwaba ni kukula muku limuka kwenu Nyambe. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Kame tumilapelelako kwa Nyambe nji mongotwe ni maata onje okukumanena ku maata no kanya yaye, nji cwale mukongotwa no kuneneba ni kutatelela, <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>mu kuwabelelwa mi mukutumele kwa Sitange woyo ona tubi etukelo no oukutabela mu kuyoola no aanu a Nyambe no kukena mu liseli. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Kame ana tulamulele ku maata no uwi mane niku tushimbulwela mu mubuso wa Mwanaye woyo osingiwa, <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>mwa yonyene natu liululwa, mu kulemenwa eibi yetu.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omunu ni Musebezi wa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kilesite yo sifekiso sa Nyambe no kwamoniwa, omweli kweyo ina umbiwa yonje. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Kakuli inu yonje kame ina tendiwa mwa yonyene, eyo ili mu wilu ni ba litunga, eyo imoniwa neyo no kwamoniwa, simba amabona, simba amaata, simba abusisi, simba etukelo, einu yonje kame ina tendiwa mwa onyene, mane na itendelwe yonyene. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Kilesite yono matatekelo kwiinu yonje, mi mwa yonyene einu yonje naikuleme bamweya. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Yokame omutwi no lutu, Ekeleke, yo matatekelo, omweeli okutunda kwaafu, nji mu inu yonje atende woyo no weli. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Kakuli mwa yonyene omwiiyalelela wonje wa Nyambe nakuwabelelwa nji wikale mwa yonyene, <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>cwale mwa yonyene ausete einu yonje kwa Yonyene naba litunga neyi na muwilu, mukutenda ekozo mu unyinga ona kwiteka ba sifapano.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Cwale naanyi ku kale kame muna kwikala oku no kuleba kwa Nyambe, me muli eila yaye mu mihupulo yenu, me mutenda emisebezi yenu no kwiiba. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Cwale kame ana myuusu mu lutu lwaye no nyama mulibaka no lifu lyaye, nji ami lite balubala lwa Nyambe, me mu kenine, me muulwile eso sinyazahala ni kulukuluha kweyo no kunungelelwa, <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Nji kame mutwalelela mu tumelo, moongole ni kwa zikinyeha, mulese okutunda mu sepo yenu no liywi no kuwaba elyo muna yupu, elyo lina kutaziwa ku yumbiwa yonje ili munji no liwilu. Mulibaka no liywi elyo mene, Paulusi kame nili esikombwa.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omusebezi wa Paulusi Omubika no Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Cwale kame ni wabelelwe mu mayando ange mulibaka lyenu, mi kame ni manenena mu unu wange kweeso sina siyala ku mayando a Kilesite mulibaka no lutu lyaye, yonyene Ekeleke, <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>eyo nina tendelwe esikombwa sayo, mu musebezi ana nibi Nyambe, mulibaka lyenu, okukumanena ku musebezi ona kubiwa kwa mene mulibaka lyenu okulimukisa eliywi lya Nyambe mukwiyala, <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>cwale ekunutu eyo, kame ina ku shweekiwa kukale ni mu masika onje, kono cwale bano nai monahalisiwa kwaanu a Nyambe no kukena. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Kwa onyene Nyambe na kuketa nji alimuke okuneneba no ufumu no kanya ili mu kunutu eyi ili mukaci no asimacaba, Eyo ya Kilesite oli mwanyi esepo no kanya. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Kilesite yatuna kwamba. Okuba emamela ku munu yonje ni kwiyeta ku munu yonje mu kushangama konje nji tulite omunu yonje no kupetahala mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Esi sokame eso ni sebeza, me nilwa mu tuso no maata aye, awo asebeza mwa mene mu koongola.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Kakuli cwale kame ni singa nji mulimuke amayando no kuneneba niyanda mulibaka lyenu nawo ali mu Laodesiya, nawo onje kasi mona olubala lwange, <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>nji emicima yoo isusuweziwe aba akuwana bamweya mu lilato, nji abiwe esifumu sonje no kuyupisisa kwiiyalile, nji alimuke ezibo no kunutu ya Nyambe, yokame Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Mwa yonyene kame ku shweekilwe esifumu sonje no ku shangama ni zibo.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Kame ni myambela eyi nji omunu alese oku myoonga ni mwambelo no kumamata. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Kakuli simba nji kani sako mu lutu, kame nili nanyi mu mebo, me ni wabelelwe okumona omwikalelo no kuwaba ni koongola kwenu mu tumelo mwa Kilesite.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwiyala no Moyo mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Cwalehe kanyi aba muna tambula Kilesite Jesu Ombumu, mutwalelele omuyoye mwa yonyene, <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>mutikise emibisi mane muyake mwa yonyene, moongole mu tumelo, kanyi omo muna iyetetwe, me mwiiyalile oukutumela.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Mu tokomele nji omunu alese omilema ni tuto no kushangama neyi na mbulwa tuso, okukumanena ni zibo no unu okuta ni mebo no inu no litunga eyo ibusa kasa eyi itunda kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Kakuli mwa yonyene mo kuli omwiiyalelela onje no Unyambe, mu lutu, <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>mi mwa yonyene na mubiwi omoyo no kwiiyala, yonyene omutwi no kubusa konje ni tukelo. <verse eid="COL 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Mwa yonyene na muti mu mupato no kwatendiwa ni maoko, me utendile oku tundisa eibi no lutu mu mupato wa Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Kame mu pumbekilwe naye mu kolobezo mi na mwingulwa naye mu ku pumena amaata a Nyambe woyo ana ingula Jesu kwaafu. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Cwale anyi mu nakufa mulibaka no tifoso tenu ni kuulwa omupato no lutu lwenu, Nyambe nami yoyisa bamweya ni yonyene, kakuli natu lemene etifoso tetu tonje, <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>na tundisa elin̄olo no mubonda no milawo owo ona kutununga, naitundisa mu kwingongotela ba sifapano. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Nakukoma amaata no abusisi ni ukutenda kwaliketwa kwaanu onje, na akomo ba sifapano mwa yonyene.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Cwalehe mulese okupumelela omunu oku myatula kweeyi no kulya ni kunwa, simba eyi no mukiti, simba omoonda no kweti, simba eli no Pumulo. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Eyo neli fela omwiinda kweyo isiiya, kono etinyutu tayo ni kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Mu lese oku pumelela omunu omyoonga nji amyulwise omupuzo no ukusiya, kweyi nouku kokobeza ni ku lapelela amangeloi, woyo no ngeeso, kame ata neyi kasimona kale, ni kununekiwa nambulwa elibaka ku mihupulo yaye no unu <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>ni kuulwa okulemenena ku Mutwi abo kwa yonyene olutu lonje kame lufepiwa ni kuwanekiwa bamweya, mi kame owanikiwa ni mooko mu malukulwelo, olemine okukula, oku kulisiwa kutunda kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyoya ni Kufa ni Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Cwalehe nji namufu ni Kilesite ku mebo no inu no litunga, iikene aba musiyoya kanyi musili mu litunga? Iikene aba musi kubeeka ku milawo eyi yaamba nji, <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>“Olese okulema esi,” “olese okulasako,” “olese okulemako?” <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Eyo yonje kame isinya omunu aba ku yoyiwa nayo, mi kame tili etitaelo ni tituto no aanu. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Eyi kame ikwite luli eponahazo no kushangama, kanyi kame ku sebelezwa Nyambe mu kusinga, nuuku kokobeza, ni mu kwababalela olutu, kono kame yulwile etuso, kakuli kaikwite amaata no kukoma etitakazo no lutu.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Nji cwale kame mu naingulwa ni Kilesite mu saele eyi na ku wilu, oko ali Kilesite woyo oikalile ku Lyooko no Silyo lya Nyambe. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Mu beeke emihupulo yenu kwiinu na kuwilu, kasa ba inu ili mu litunga. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Kakuli namufu, mi omoyo wenu kame ona shweekiwa ni Kilesite mwa Nyambe. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Cwale Kilesite woyo oli omoyo wenu aba sa monahale, mi naanyi mba mu monahala naye mu kanya.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omoyo no Kale ni Moyo no Ubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Cwalehe mwiibae eyo ili no litunga mwaanyi, ounyazi, okwaakena, amaikuto no kwiiba, etitakazo no kwiiba, ni takazo no kufuma, eyo itendile kanyi oku sebeleza emilimu. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Mulibaka no inu eyi okutweba kwa Nyamba kame kwiiya. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Naanyi yokame eyo muna kweenda nayo ku kale, abo me mu siyoya nayo.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Kono cwale bano yonje mwiitundise, okutina, okutweba, olunya, okunyefula ni kwamba eyi yenisa oku tunda mu tunwa twenu. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Mulese okoonga omunjili ku munjili, mu mone nji na mu tundisa eyi no kale ni misebezi yayo <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>mi na muku fuku woyo no ubya, woyo ona ku shemunwa mu sifekiso sa woyo ona muumbu. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Bano kakwisa Omugelike simba Omujuda, okuta ku mupato simba okwaata ku mupato, simba Omun̄ete, Eikebenga, omubika simba no ku lukuluha, kono Kilesite yo inu yonje, mu inu onje.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Mu kufuke cwale kanyi awo aketilwe kwa Nyambe, aa nokukena niku singiwa, aa ali ni maikuto no makeke, ni musa, nuuku kokobeza, ni kotoba ni mucima no kutatelela. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Mu kuuse omunjili ku munjili, nji omunu kame ali neso abilaela ku mukwaye, mukulemene, kanyi Ombumu aba ana milemene, cwale naanyi mulemene ngeeso. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Cwale beulu no inu yonje mukufuke elilato, elyo linunga einu yonje mu ku petahala. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Cwale mulese ekozo ya Kilesite ibuse mu micima yenu, eyo muna isanenwe nji mutende olutu lumweya. Mi muku tumele. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Mulesele eliywi lya Kilesite liyake mwaanyi mu ufumu, mu kwiiyete, ni ku kutazana omunjili ku munjili mu ku shangama konje, mi mwiimbe mu lisamu, ni milumbeko ni tindimo no mebo nuukutumela mu micima yenu kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Cwale eyo yonje mutenda, mu liywi simba mu misebezi, mutende esinu sonje mu litina lya Mbumu Jesu, nuukutumela kwa Nyambe Sitetu mwa yonyene.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Owikalo no Munu mu Moyo no Ubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Akati mu kubeeke kunji nwa mbumwenu, kanyi moku fanenena kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="COL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Alume musinge amoywenu, mi mulese okwa twebela.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Aana muyupele ashemienu, kakuli kame siwabelisa Ombumu.<verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Ashemi, mulese oku twebela aneenu, nji alese kuzwafa.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Abika, mu yupele aolyenu no litunga mu inu yonje, kasa okwa sebeleza aba amyaliketa ni miyo fela, kanyi kame musinga oku wabelisa aanu, kono ni mucima mumweya, me mucila Ombumu. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Eso musebeza sonje, musisebeze kanyi kame musebeleza Ombumu kasa aanu. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Me mulimukile nji oku tunda mwa Mbumu kame sa mu tambule omupuzo no ku yoola esanda, kakuli kame mu sebeleza Ombumu Kilesite. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Kakuli woyo otenda eyi no kwiiba kame satenekiwe okuta kweyo no kwiiba ana tende, mi abo kakwisa esaluluti.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Ambumu, mubabalele abika enu wino ni niti, me mulimukile nji naanyi kame muli ni Mbumu wenu ku wilu.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Mu twalelele okongooteta mu kulapela, mu tokomele aba mu lapela nuukutumela. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Cwale naaci mutulapelele, nji Nyambe atu yatulwele endila no liywi, mi twaambe ekunutu ya Kilesite eyo ni nungelwe mulibaka lyalyo, <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>nji ni ilimukise mu mukwa owo ni saela oku yaamba.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Mutende awo no kushangama kweyo mutenda kwaawo no kwapumena, me mu yolisa etinako. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Mulesele omwambelo wenu otenda owo oli ni musa enako yonje kanyi kame olungilwe omungwa, nji cwale mulimuke eso mufanena oku tambula omunu yonje.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulaano no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Taikikasi kame sa myambele eyange yonje, mwabange no ku singiwa, woyo no kusepahala, esikombwa mwa Mbumu kanyi meene. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Kame nina mutumu kwaanyi mulibaka elyi nji mulimuke omo tuyoyela mane amisusuweze emicima yenu. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Cwale kame aiya ni Onesimasi omwabange osingiwa ni kusepapala, omunjili mwaanyi. Kame samyambele eyi ina tendahala kuno yonje.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Elisitakasi omwabange elipantiti kame ami keeta, ni Maleka omwiibaye Banabasi, (okukumanena woyo muna tambwele etitaelo nji kame aiye kwaanyi, mu mutambule wino), <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>ni Jesu woyo wiisaniwa nji Jusitusi. Aa Amajuda feela mukaci kwawo ni sebeza noo mulibaka no mubuso wa Nyambe, mi kame anoongota omucima.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Epafulasi, omunjili mwaanyi, omubika wa Kilesite Jesu ni yonyene kame amikeeta, kame amihupula onene enako yonje mu milapelo yaye nambulwa okwangwa, nji mwimane mu kusepahala, mi mukubeeke oku manenenena ku kusinga kwa Nyambe konje. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Kakuli kame ni mupaka onene nji nami sebeleze onene naa ali mu Laodisiya ni mu Hilapolisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Luka onganga osingwa ni Demasi, kame amikeeta.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Mu ni keetete abaange mu Laodisiya ni Ninfasi, ni Keleke ili mu ndoo yaye. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Cwale elin̄olo eli aba mumana okulibalelwa, lika baliwe kame ni mu Keleke na mu Laodisiya, mi naanyi mu mone nji kame mubala elin̄olo eli litunda ku Laodisiya. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Cwale mwaambele Akipo kame nji, “Wiyatetete omusebezi ona tambula mwa Mbumu.”<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Mene Paulusi kame nina n̄olo amaywi aa no kukeeta ni Lyoko lyange. Mupuluke okunungiwa kwange!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Esishemo siikale naanyi.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
